# Herdr-supervised run transcripts: commit only the digest (session_sha256 in
# RunDoc/run.yaml) and result-summary.md, not the raw JSONL session. Decision
# recorded in desk/drawer/questions/question-herdr-runtime-open-decisions.md
# (decision 2): avoids permanently bloating the repo with hundreds of MB of
# transcripts (measured median 206KB, p90 1.1MB, max 21MB per pi session).
runs/subagents/*/session.jsonl
